The components in this package are adapted to Solid/TypeScript. Resource files under src/components/generated are generated from that revision by packages/build/src/sync-ui-resources.ts.

Native-profile adaptations are applied in crates/ui-bridge/examples/ui_resources.rs
before generation; both capture and crates/ui-bridge/tests/sdk_resources.rs
preflight every component sheet with the actual strict native parser, plus all
generated theme declarations:
- AvatarStyle maps upstream :broken to native :state(zgui-image-broken).
- BadgeStyle and ButtonStyle omit Gecko-only text-underline-offset: 4px;
  native underline painting retains its supported default offset.
- InputGroupPartStyle omits browser-only resize: none; native editors have no
  user resize affordance. Native layout/sizing declarations remain unchanged.
No unsupported native declaration is silently dropped during installation.
